docs {
  # GET /apis/artworks/art-curators/ — List art curators
  
  Returns the paginated list of art curators. Requires `Authorization: Token`.
  
  ## Status codes
  
  - `200 OK` — success
  - `401 Unauthorized` — missing or invalid token
  
  ## Response (200)
  
  ```json
  {
    "count": 1,
    "next": null,
    "previous": null,
    "page": 1,
    "page_size": 12,
    "total_pages": 1,
    "results": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "slug": "maria-rodriguez",
        "is_active": true,
        "created_at": "2026-08-17T10:00:00Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-08-17T10:00:00Z",
        "name": "María Rodríguez",
        "email": "maria@example.com",
        "website": "https://example.com",
        "photo": "https://enredarte-dashboard.localhost/media/curators/maria.webp",
        "translations": {
          "es": { "bio": "Curadora independiente." },
          "en": { "bio": "Independent curator." }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  ## Error (401)
  
  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Invalid token.",
    "data": {}
  }
  ```
}
